# CR 702.4: a double striker deals combat damage in both the First Strike
# Damage step and the regular Combat Damage step -- Raging Redcap (1/2,
# Double Strike, unblocked) hits ai for 1 in each, 2 total, not the 1 a
# plain attacker's single combatdamage step would deal.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
